00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.310
like the look of liquid glass where the

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.590
different menus and things are

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.590
transparent and that makes it a little

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.029
harder to see what you're doing, there

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:18.590
is no way to turn off liquid glass, but

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.189
there are some settings changes we can

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:22.670
make to make it easier to see and reduce

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.669
the transparency. So to do that, open up

00:00:24.679 --> 00:00:26.910
the settings on your iPhone. Then just

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.830
scroll down to the second section and

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.069
select accessibility. Once in there,

00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:33.549
select display and text size. And then

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:35.150
all you want to do is select reduce

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.990
transparency. Now you can go back to

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.910
your home screen. And when you open up a

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.910
folder, as you can see, there is no

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.229
transparent liquid glass look.

00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:44.830
Additionally, if you find that the menu

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.790
buttons on your home screen or the icons

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.470
are a little hard to see, we can change

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.150
the look of that by simply holding down

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.470
on a blank area of your home screen and

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.549
then selecting edit in the top left.

00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:58.349
From there, select customize. And you

00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:00.750
just want to choose either dark and

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.910
that'll make it darker or you can choose

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:05.310
tinted and change the colors there. So,

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.670
if you want it to be a little bit

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.910
darker, depending on your needs, you can

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.469
choose different colors and make it dark

00:01:11.479 --> 00:01:13.870
